://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           Cusco区域是上图紫色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于 新联盟\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span>\n            新联盟农场园\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           位于秘鲁库斯科地区圣特雷莎区域，海拔约1800至1900米，周围被原始森林环绕，自然的遮荫条件和多样的生态环境（在秘鲁这种环境很多）\n          </span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           ；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n            Dwlight在咖啡农场和群山中长大，这片土地原属于他的父亲Timoteo Aguilar - 父亲在1969年土地改革期间获得了这片土地。那个时期标志着秘鲁农村历史的深刻变革，\"土地归于耕者\"的口号成为现实。从那时起，这句话一直指引着德怀特及其家人的日常努力，他们通过辛勤劳作、奉献精神和对咖啡的热爱，延续着父亲的传承；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7ogvNib0WP16DujWdQoibWZDGesVKqAXQYHmer9u6E5pASiaNZlzPRpWVTuXhCYOfo6ia8m4zI2VXGK110LgmlZmn2thjvpp8lPMM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4VXeyJngArjy28libnf4RNkOKQxaiaIOnMQYCntq4ehKPIonXUibkxsToWBgwClWKxWq5zSiaTcZO9JYUj8kSFenFztsGDzobAB6o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b5gQq7MKqqTRH16ZjiatwRh8DISGPT7ic0ibn4eaib9GCJicCsTLJ5KL3GUiaicobCj9E7lLX68pLXFjdtjm8WVreHFxCCOViaEpcOfPuk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           我们的主角1: 黄瑰夏\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6KickoenEic3QNWcBDGfQ2wWlkb2C5Pxic25rAxicO7RpZYmeOcoCxUgicoLyV2wWIPekSsaI9MjTLRxVpuePfZ3mn5Ml8cmsicK7VE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           主角2: Dwight（非常认真和有商业头脑）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b46mDicHgyicGthCR3hxz05emGQaA26W4ibg6rDsfwDE7QxF6OZMAYYrmOMicicqDicicSodH2bVeCn0KPR81RBuOS7sOraH0YanomfXA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           非常干净的水洗池和处理设备（全不锈钢定制的），是我去过的咖农中zui干净整洁的\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7m7mXXVj1GEjOpAEME55UC025JCYXVel5dIjdlKUuquqgrnpmE52Lic9AhB3O6RPk8icicethKuq5tYrtVWcJM8AOjpHjDTibVy08/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7JoPnjn3MNoSunlZYPnLU1ruayt3o3SP6dpdq547HPx2MuyPB7VGkm1DrKtKlBTWAOHBvcGKNYDNkAMYa0UV9rg6avLJSj0Gc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b46vPhDjfBhw1boOnIH5536oH1NIGHMQ72X3aHxqBJJyU3AgrRvjwhzibib9sLy6aECOoy9qOpiaqAyImkeY4F9QBwtxDLWwjqQqI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n            在发酵中的水洗批次（发酵罐里还有一个内袋），室外，简单的遮荫，但是环境温度自然就很低\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           其他的一些视频\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b69h2oJjpXYQVx4k6MQsty6NtwIpviamt81yBicsPyxxtNxwqrficvuBHibWSJYphj6hsm9s86qnTBRNPE29p9HCofvMYePOqicpvvE%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4427298493455794177\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4427298493455794177\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"1920\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n           <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type 